            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Ngon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mnanne\nBelgrade, Serbia112 contributions\n0\nExcellent and authentic Vietnamese food!\nDec 2015 • Family\nWe were taken to this restaurant by our travel agent. The food was delicious- authentic Vietnamese food, really big portions, cooked to perfection and best of all was the ambience of a 5 star place! highly recommended for those who want to eat real Vietnamese food, at economical rates and in style!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 9, 2016",
