            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Ngon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "lee r\n195 contributions\n0\nTotally poor.\nOct 2015 • Solo\nIt is in a Korean department store called Lotte.\nOne of the best Department companies in Asia.\nThe main store's annual sales is top3 in the world.\nSo I expected a bit more.\nYou can have better food with cheaper price even in the department stores in Korea.\n\nIt was worse than the street food in Vietnam also.\nThe servers were quite okay though.\n\nThis is quite okay for the local riches...\nBasically it wasn't that bad.\n\nHowever I was a bit sad, because it is the one of the best department stores in hanoi.\nBut I rate this one for the foreigners who use this webpage.\nI recommend you to go to the expensive restaurants in the street.\nThey are expensive but well made.\nThis one is expensive but poor.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 18, 2015",
